  "bug": {
    "reproduction": "Parent QLabel rule20px -> preview50%=10px; parent updated30px -> preview15px; reset100% removes temporary stylesheet but label remains15px after5s. Reproduced with a fresh child panel.",
    "fix": "When resetting removes an empty-base preview override, repolish its subtree and invoke QWidget geometry/repaint methods explicitly. Restores30px without retaining a local stylesheet or changing the parent rule.",
    "regression_caught": "Initial repolish draft called a QListView update overload with no index. Existing Measure/UMAP cases caught it; final code calls QWidget.update directly and all43checks pass."
  },
